<title>UK: S&amp;P gives seven Colombian bank public info ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P gives seven Colombian bank public info ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said in a statement released on Tuesday it gave seven Colombian banks public information (p.i.) ratings.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it rated Banco Ganadero SA, Banco de Bogota SA and Banco Industrial Colombiana SA at BBB p.i. It rated Banco de Colombia SA, Banco Comercial Antioqueno SA and Banco Popular SA at BB p.i. It rated Bancafe at B p.i., the agency said.</p>
<p>&quot;The seven p.i. ratings reflect Standard &amp; Poor's view of the banking system as the second strongest in Latin America,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
